{"2437710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "蜀境传说-回合", "steam_appid": 2437710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《蜀境传说》是一款仙侠题材回合制策略游戏。</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437710/extras/c62c0159000797f5223be9dbd761ca69.avif?t=1694747000\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br><strong>游戏以精致的画风、多线的剧情和炫酷的技能，为玩家呈现蜀山世界的众生百态。<br>游戏讲述了六大门派幻境探险、诛妖除魔的故事，玩家可以自由选择门派，通过百种技能搭配、多种阵容组合，畅享策略战斗的过程。<br>游戏专注人宠合作战斗体系，多样的玩法系统，让志同道合的大侠能建立一个联盟共同抗敌。快快携手好友邂逅属于你的蜀山世界！</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437710/extras/68c611c9b6d1ec006628c1b11233c47d.avif?t=1694747000\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【热血战斗 跨服争霸】</h2><strong>即时战斗、竞技场、跨服pvp随心所欲PK，想打就打；圣天城战，仙盟争霸赛一触即发，万人争夺名人堂神殿控制权！</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437710/extras/daa32b8086bf030f9a1ffeb608292c1c.avif?t=1694747000\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【天赐良缘，情定三生】</h2><strong>漫长的修仙道路上遇见那个ta，注定今生相伴而行，结成仙侣携手共度浪漫一生。组队修行，加入仙盟齐心共展宏图。好友并肩作战，一同闯荡仙界，江湖恩怨快意平生。</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437710/extras/4.jpg?t=1694747000\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【多样副本，成就王者】</h2><strong>凡人修真，金蝉宝库，封神台，魔王挑战等多样副本，降妖除魔历练成神，修真境界提升，飞升渡劫一统仙界，成为诛神领袖，体验做神仙的快感！</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437710/extras/5.jpg?t=1694747000\" /></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《蜀境传说》是一款仙侠题材回合制策略游戏。</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437710/extras/c62c0159000797f5223be9dbd761ca